# RPi5 Deployment

Merge to `main`. `.github/workflows/deploy-rpi5.yml` builds the system in CI, pushes
it to the nsimon-nicos Cachix, and the Cachix Deploy agent on the Pi activates it.
Home Manager is the NixOS module, so it is activated with the system
(`home-manager-nsimon.service`). There is no standalone `nsimon@rpi5` config.

The Pi cannot evaluate its own config (~2.1 GiB eval RSS, earlyoom kills it), so
do not run `nixos-rebuild` or `home-manager switch` there.

Auto-merged PRs start no workflow run; the 30-minute schedule picks them up.
Check `stat -c %y /run/current-system` after a deploy, and re-run with
`gh workflow run deploy-rpi5.yml --ref main -f force=true` if it did not activate.
